<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pacific BBA year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pacific BBA year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   33.93 vs  34.15</p>
<p>    Net profit		   16.87 vs  15.90</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	 loss 6.87 vs  loss 11.24</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)    8.0  vs   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Pacific BBA Ltd is an automotive parts and plastic products manufacturer.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)    13.0 vs  13.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   13.2 vs  12.9</p>
<p>    Sales			 477.31 vs 464.21</p>
<p>    Other income		 31.30 vs  24.24</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date May 9</p>
<p>Reg date April 30</p>
<p>    Tax			     7.54 vs   5.95</p>
<p>    Interest			8.25 vs   8.40</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 22.38 vs  20.97</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
